---
interface Props {
	title: string;
}

const { title } = Astro.props;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<title>{title}</title>
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
		<style>
			* {
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}
			
			body {
				font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
				background: #ffffff;
				color: #1a1a1a;
				line-height: 1.6;
				-webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
				print-color-adjust: exact;
			}

			@media print {
				.no-print { display: none !important; }
				body { padding: 0; margin: 0; }
				.cv-container { padding: 0 !important; max-width: 100% !important; }
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main class="cv-container">
			<header class="cv-header">
				<h1>Abdul Malik Adz-Dzikri</h1>
				<p class="cv-title">Informatika / Web Developer</p>
				<div class="cv-contact">
					<span>WhatsApp: +62 852-5926-4009</span>
					<span class="separator">|</span>
					<span>Email: malikdark17@gmail.com</span>
					<span class="separator">|</span>
					<span>GitHub: Malikzert</span>
					<span class="separator">|</span>
					<span>Instagram: @malikzert</span>
				</div>
			</header>

			<section class="cv-section">
				<h2>Summary</h2>
				<p>
					Mahasiswa Informatika yang berdedikasi menciptakan solusi digital efisien, fokus pada 
					pengembangan web modern, dan pemecahan masalah teknis.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="cv-section">
				<h2>Skills</h2>
				
				<div class="skill-group">
					<h3>Advanced</h3>
					<div class="skill-badges">
						<span class="badge badge-advanced">HTML5 - Advanced</span>
						<span class="badge badge-advanced">CSS3 - Advanced</span>
						<span class="badge badge-advanced">Python - Advanced</span>
						<span class="badge badge-advanced">Modern UI Design - Advanced</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="skill-group">
					<h3>Intermediate</h3>
					<div class="skill-badges">
						<span class="badge badge-intermediate">JavaScript - Intermediate</span>
						<span class="badge badge-intermediate">React - Intermediate</span>
						<span class="badge badge-intermediate">Laravel - Intermediate</span>
						<span class="badge badge-intermediate">MySQL - Intermediate</span>
						<span class="badge badge-intermediate">PHP - Intermediate</span>
						<span class="badge badge-intermediate">C# - Intermediate</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="skill-group">
					<h3>Beginner / Learning</h3>
					<div class="skill-badges">
						<span class="badge badge-learning">Astro Framework - Learning</span>
						<span class="badge badge-learning">Debian - Beginner</span>
						<span class="badge badge-learning">Linux Mint - Beginner</span>
						<span class="badge badge-learning">Git/GitHub - Beginner</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="cv-section">
				<h2>Education</h2>
				<div class="cv-entry">
					<div class="cv-entry-header">
						<h3>S1 Teknik Informatika</h3>
						<span class="cv-date">2023 - Sekarang</span>
					</div>
					<p class="cv-location">Fokus pada Web Development & Software Engineering</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="cv-section">
				<h2>Projects</h2>
				
				<div class="cv-entry">
					<div class="cv-entry-header">
						<h3>Elektroshop</h3>
						<span class="cv-date">2024</span>
					</div>
					<ul>
						<li>Platform e-commerce untuk penjualan produk elektronik</li>
						<li>Implementasi sistem keranjang belanja dan pembayaran</li>
						<li>Desain responsif dengan antarmuka pengguna yang modern</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="cv-entry">
					<div class="cv-entry-header">
						<h3>Ular Tangga</h3>
						<span class="cv-date">2024</span>
					</div>
					<ul>
						<li>Game ular tangga dengan fitur pembelajaran interaktif</li>
						<li>Implementasi logika permainan dan AI sederhana</li>
						<li>Menggunakan Python dan Pygame</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="cv-entry">
					<div class="cv-entry-header">
						<h3>Neural Network</h3>
						<span class="cv-date">2024</span>
					</div>
					<ul>
						<li>Proyek pengenalan tulisan tangan menggunakan deep learning</li>
						<li>Training model neural network dengan dataset MNIST</li>
						<li>Implementasi Convolutional Neural Network (CNN)</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</section>

			<div class="cv-actions no-print">
				<button onclick="window.print()" class="btn">Print / Save as PDF</button>
			</div>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.cv-container {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 50px 40px;
	}

	.cv-header {
		margin-bottom: 35px;
		padding-bottom: 25px;
		border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1a1a;
	}

	.cv-header h1 {
		font-size: 2.2rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #1a1a1a;
		margin-bottom: 5px;
	}

	.cv-title {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: #444;
		margin-bottom: 15px;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.cv-contact {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: #333;
	}

	.cv-contact .separator {
		margin: 0 10px;
		color: #999;
	}

	.cv-section {
		margin-bottom: 30px;
	}

	.cv-section h2 {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #1a1a1a;
		margin-bottom: 15px;
		padding-bottom: 8px;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
	}

	.cv-section > p {
		color: #333;
		text-align: justify;
	}

	.skill-group {
		margin-bottom: 18px;
	}

	.skill-group h3 {
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #555;
		margin-bottom: 10px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.5px;
	}

	.skill-badges {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 8px;
	}

	.badge {
		padding: 6px 14px;
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		border: 1px solid;
	}

	.badge-advanced {
		background: #1a1a1a;
		color: #fff;
		border-color: #1a1a1a;
	}

	.badge-intermediate {
		background: #f5f5f5;
		color: #1a1a1a;
		border-color: #ccc;
	}

	.badge-learning {
		background: #fff;
		color: #666;
		border-color: #ddd;
	}

	.cv-entry {
		margin-bottom: 20px;
	}

	.cv-entry-header {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: baseline;
		margin-bottom: 8px;
	}

	.cv-entry-header h3 {
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #1a1a1a;
	}

	.cv-date {
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: #666;
	}

	.cv-location {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: #555;
		margin-top: -5px;
	}

	.cv-entry ul {
		margin: 0;
		padding-left: 20px;
	}

	.cv-entry ul li {
		color: #333;
		margin-bottom: 5px;
	}

	.cv-actions {
		text-align: center;
		margin-top: 40px;
		padding-top: 25px;
	}

	.btn {
		padding: 12px 30px;
		background: #1a1a1a;
		color: #fff;
		border: none;
		border-radius: 6px;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		cursor: pointer;
		font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
		transition: background 0.2s;
	}

	.btn:hover {
		background: #333;
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.cv-container {
			padding: 30px 20px;
		}

		.cv-header h1 {
			font-size: 1.6rem;
		}

		.cv-entry-header {
			flex-direction: column;
		}

		.cv-contact {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 5px;
		}

		.cv-contact .separator {
			display: none;
		}
	}
</style>
